00:02:05.476 --> 00:02:11.136
The battery supply sets the hard ceiling on how many vehicles, energy products, and robots

00:02:11.136 --> 00:02:12.676
Tesla can build at once.

00:02:13.196 --> 00:02:18.556
Demand now pulls from passenger cars that already carry multi-year backlogs, megapacks that

00:02:18.556 --> 00:02:23.876
are nearly sold out through 2027, and the much larger cell counts required by each cyber

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:24.676
cab and semi.

00:02:25.356 --> 00:02:31.196
Tesla is responding by scaling 4680 production at Giga, Texas toward North America's largest

00:02:31.196 --> 00:02:37.596
cell plant, adding lithium iron phosphate or LFP capacity in Nevada, building cathode

00:02:37.596 --> 00:02:42.996
and lithium facilities in Texas, and expanding pack lines in Berlin while locking in longer

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:44.516
term supplier contracts.

00:02:45.116 --> 00:02:50.076
The constraint is not demand or factory floor space, but the kilograms of cells that can

00:02:50.076 --> 00:02:52.036
be produced and qualified each month.

00:02:52.696 --> 00:02:58.976
Every additional 4680 line or LFP plant therefore multiplies the addressable volume across

00:02:58.976 --> 00:03:04.336
every program, rather than just one. When cell output rises, the same increment

00:03:04.336 --> 00:03:09.636
supports more model-wise, more mega-packs for data centers, and the first batches

00:03:09.636 --> 00:03:13.916
of Optimus units without forcing trade-offs between segments. Vertical

00:03:13.916 --> 00:03:18.396
integration on cells also changes the cost curve because internal production

00:03:18.396 --> 00:03:22.796
gives Tesla direct control over yield improvements and chemistry tweaks that

00:03:22.796 --> 00:03:27.256
outside suppliers would price at a premium. The result is lower cost per

00:03:27.256 --> 00:03:32.576
kilowatt hour that flows straight into gross margin on vehicles, energy storage, and eventually

00:03:32.576 --> 00:03:35.896
the robot fleet, rather than remaining a supplier margin.

00:03:36.436 --> 00:03:41.856
Until cell capacity stops being the bottleneck, every other expansion plan remains gated by

00:03:41.856 --> 00:03:43.176
the single physical limit.

